{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","流矢疾锋"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Gale Barrage"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对扇形范围内的敌人连续发射箭矢造成伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Kazim continuously fires arrows at enemies within the arc-shaped area, dealing damage."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，当敌方英雄被击飞时，卡兹姆将引动气流，使其滞空时间延长1秒，并发射两枚追踪羽毛，对目标造成100% + 10% ATK伤害。主动释放时，向覆盖敌人最多的扇形方向发射一波强力箭矢，造成320% + 40% ATK伤害，并将范围内的所有“猎物”击飞0.5秒，随后连续发射箭矢造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，持续3秒，该技能的动作受攻击速度影响。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Passive. When an enemy hero is knocked into the air, Kazim manipulates the air currents to keep them airborne for 1s longer, then fires 2 tracking feathers at the target, dealing 100% + 10% ATK damage each.\nActive. Kazim fires a powerful volley of arrows at the arc-shaped area with the most enemies, dealing 320% + 40% ATK damage and knocking all prey within range into the air for 0.5s. After that, he keeps firing arrows in succession for 3s, dealing 200% + 20% ATK damage per volley. The number of volleys fired scales with ATK SPD."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":99,"end":105,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":145,"end":151,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":183,"end":189,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":313,"end":319,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":458,"end":464,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":95,"end":109,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":141,"end":155,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":179,"end":193,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":309,"end":323,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":454,"end":468,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","强力箭矢造成的伤害提升至340% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the powerful arrow damage to 340% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","强力箭矢造成的伤害提升至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the powerful arrow damage to 360% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","强力箭矢造成的伤害提升至380% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the powerful arrow damage to 380% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","强力箭矢造成的伤害提升至400% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases the powerful arrow damage to 400% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","鹰翔长空"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Soaring Falcon"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时翱翔于空中寻找“猎物”。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","When a battle starts, Kazim takes to the air and hunts for prey from above."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，战斗开始时卡兹姆腾空而起，进入“翱翔”状态，持续10秒。“翱翔”状态下，卡兹姆无敌且不可选中，当敌方英雄被击飞时，对其发起俯冲造成440% + 50% ATK伤害，并将其标记为“猎物”。退出“翱翔”状态时，卡兹姆将拉弓对所有“猎物”依次发射一道强力箭矢造成400% + 40% ATK伤害，并将目标眩晕3秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Passive. When a battle starts, Kazim takes to the air and starts Soaring for 10s. While Soaring, Kazim is invincible and cannot be targeted. When an enemy hero is knocked into the air, Kazim dives at them, dealing 440% + 50% ATK damage and marking them as prey. When Kazim stops Soaring, he draws his bow and fires a powerful arrow at each prey in sequence, dealing 400% + 40% ATK damage and stunning them for 3s."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":73,"end":79,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":136,"end":142,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":218,"end":224,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":370,"end":376,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":69,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":132,"end":146,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":214,"end":228,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":366,"end":380,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","俯冲造成的伤害提升至460% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases dive damage to 460% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","俯冲造成的伤害提升至480% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases dive damage to 480% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","俯冲造成的伤害提升至500% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases dive damage to 500% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","猎风之境"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Stormy Dominion"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","射出附带狂风之力的箭矢，造成伤害并击飞敌人。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Kazim fires a gale-charged arrow, dealing damage to enemies and knocking them into the air."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，卡兹姆生成覆盖全场的“风场”。“风场”中的友方获得30点急速。卡兹每标记一名“猎物”，会使“风场”额外提升10点急速，最多叠加3层。退出“翱翔”状态后，卡兹姆将“风场”力量凝聚于自身，获得双倍增益，持续15秒。主动释放时，卡兹姆向敌方最密集的方向射出附带狂风之力的箭矢，对路径上的敌人造成340% + 40% ATK伤害，并击飞0.5秒。每标记一名“猎物”，该箭矢的伤害和范围永久提高20%，最多叠加3层。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When a battle starts, Kazim creates a wind field that covers the entire battlefield. Allies inside the wind field gain 30 Haste. Every time Kazim marks an enemy as prey, the wind field grants 10 extra Haste to allies within it, up to 3 stacks. When Kazim stops soaring, he absorbs the power of the wind field, gaining double the Haste bonus for 15s.\nActive. Kazim fires a gale-charged arrow toward the area with the most enemies, dealing 340% + 40% ATK damage to enemies in its path and knocking them into the air for 0.5s. Every time Kazim marks an enemy as prey, this arrow's damage and range are permanently increased by 20%, up to 3 stacks."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":154,"end":160,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":442,"end":448,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":150,"end":164,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":438,"end":452,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the impact damage to 360% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至380% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the impact damage to 380% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至400% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the impact damage to 400% + 40% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提升攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，卡兹姆提升21点攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD by 21 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，卡兹姆提升27点攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD by 27 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，卡兹姆提升33点攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD by 33 during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","鹰睃狼顾"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Raptor's Vigil"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","普通攻击锁定所有“猎物”。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Kazim's normal attacks lock on to all prey."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","卡兹姆造成的普攻伤害提升25%，且普通攻击会锁定所有“猎物”。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Kazim's normal attacks deal 25% more damage and lock on to all enemies marked as prey."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的普攻伤害提升30%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases normal attack damage by 30%."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","卡兹姆每进行6次普攻，会射出更强力的箭矢，将攻击目标击飞0.25秒并造成最大生命20%的真实伤害，至多不超过卡兹姆500% ATK，每标记一名“猎物”，本技能触发所需普通攻击次数降低1次，最多叠加3次。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Every 6 normal attacks, Kazim fires an enhanced arrow, knocking the target into the air for 0.25s and dealing true damage equal to 20% of the target's max HP. The true damage dealt cannot exceed Kazim's 500% ATK. Every time Kazim marks an enemy as prey, the number of normal attacks required to trigger this skill is reduced by 1, up to 3 stacks."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":57,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":203,"end":211,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的普攻伤害提升35%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases normal attack damage by 35%."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","引动气流击飞敌人，标记“猎物”后获得攻击速度和能量。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Kazim manipulates the air currents to knock an enemy into the air. He gains ATK SPD and Energy whenever he marks an enemy as prey."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","卡兹姆进入“翱翔”状态2秒后引动气流，击飞最靠后且没有移动过的非霸体、稳定敌方英雄，每当卡兹姆标记“猎物”或敌方英雄被击败时，永久提升20点攻击速度并获得200点能量，攻击速度至多叠加5层。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","2s after Kazim starts Soaring, he manipulates air currents to knock the rearmost enemy hero into the air (only targets enemies who have not moved since the battle began, excluding unaffected and steadfast targets). Whenever Kazim marks an enemy as prey or an enemy hero is defeated, he permanently gains 20 ATK SPD and 200 Energy. The ATK SPD bonus can stack up to 5 times."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":35,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":180,"end":190,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":195,"end":204,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","赤羽苍弦"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Wingstring Azure"]]}